 36AR c  2009Sc20: ({+12}C,{+12}C) E(c.m.)=10.67-16 MeV; analyzed angular       
 36AR2c  distributions and excitation functions, deduced resonances, resonance  
 36AR3c  parameters, hyperdeformed structures, elongated shape isomers and      
 36AR4c  moments of inertia using shell model, cluster configurations,          
 36AR4c  S-matrix analysis. Also 2009Cs02 about theory of elongated shape       
 36AR4c  isomers                                                                
 36AR c  1984Me12: E(c.m.)=14.20 MeV, angular distribution of three |a          
 36AR2c  groups point out to apparent resonant structure. Determined its        
 36AR2c  J|p by Regge-pole and phase shift analysis                             
 36AR c  Others: 1982Ga09 ({+24}Mg({+12}C,|a), E(c.m.)=23.83-29.83 MeV;         
 36AR2c  {+12}C({+24}Mg,|a), E(c.m.)=16.37-22.70 MeV, measured total fusion     
 36AR2c  cross sections); 1981Me10 ({+24}Mg({+12}C,{+12}C) and                  
 36AR2c  {+24}Mg({+12}C,{+12}C'), E(c.m.)=12-27 MeV, measured |s(|q,E);         
